President of Tokorozawa

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.710
I'll check in with our agents

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:53.130
to see why we haven't gotten any of the cores we expected to have by now.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:54.760
Please hurry.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:01.510
Why?

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:04.680
I made friends.

