Last night's scuffle mustn't happen again.

00:18:10.850 --> 00:18:15.940
Concert hall conflicts are not the
responsibility of Maikos, We Are.

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:19.530
However true that may be, there was a kidnapping...

00:18:19.530 --> 00:18:23.200
Shuten Doji does not kill people.

00:18:23.200 --> 00:18:25.740
He cares only to kill time, no?

00:18:25.740 --> 00:18:27.960
This whole situation is but a farce.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:30.870
Kyoto is no "holy land" of rock.

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:33.840
I do enjoy a bit of rock.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:35.920
A-Apologies.

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.550
Miss Mamechiyo, do you hate rock as well?

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.100
O-Of course!

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:48.230
What are you planning?

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:51.730
You like wild fights, right?

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:56.730
I don't think you'd enjoy watching people struggle because I'm gone.

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:05.200
I would enjoy catching a fight between the Rockr's and Maikos captains.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.330
Well, <i>I</i> wouldn't enjoy it.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.330
I was wondering what she'd be like...

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.080
She's a cool young woman, huh?

00:19:12.880 --> 00:19:13.580
Huh?

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:15.710
Just talking to myself.

00:19:15.710 --> 00:19:18.380
You came all this way. Why not sing us a song?

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.340
Huh?

00:19:21.880 --> 00:19:25.470
We'll ask someone for their stone before they toss it out.

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:28.020
Do you mean those jinxed stones?

00:19:28.350 --> 00:19:29.640
Jinxed stones?

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:34.560
There aren't any around now, but they usually rain down after good concerts.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:38.110
There are boxes around town for people to get rid of them in.

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:40.030
What a waste! Why?

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:45.450
They may be pretty, but they've been considered unlucky around these parts for quite some time.

00:19:45.450 --> 00:19:47.740
Not many other than the captain have one.

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.500
Why do you want such a thing?
All right! Let's go!

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:53.000
Hey, wait!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:57.540
I wonder what it means that they rain down after a good concert?

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:01.170
What are those stones, anyway?

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:07.220
The stones enhance neuron synapses.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:09.810
Noticing the activation of sympathetic nerves,

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:14.310
the basal ganglia cancels signals inhibiting body functions sent to the muscles.

00:20:15.440 --> 00:20:19.860
This allows people to exhibit more than 100% of their true potential.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:24.030
In addition, in order to prevent bones and muscles from being destroyed,

00:20:24.030 --> 00:20:26.620
it's possible that they also put a coating on the cells...

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:32.700
I don't really know what you're talking about, but can they make amazing shachihoko, too?!

00:20:32.700 --> 00:20:37.420
Uh... Well, about that...

00:20:39.210 --> 00:20:41.170
Oh, the box...

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.170
Stones are falling!

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:44.260
Where, Chi?

00:20:44.260 --> 00:20:46.300
Um... Maybe over there?

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:48.300
Oh, someone's here!

00:20:54.730 --> 00:20:56.440
E-Excuse me!

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.190
Nozomi!

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:00.690
After him!

00:21:01.230 --> 00:21:03.740
Johnny, you wanted to be a guitarist, right?

00:21:03.740 --> 00:21:06.610
Yes, but I can't play an F chord.

00:21:06.610 --> 00:21:08.870
And Marukome, you wanted to be a drummer?

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:11.450
But I have no rhythm.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:14.370
What if the captain sings and plays bass?

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.960
That's pretty good. Momi-Ham style...

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:18.630
Are those girls going to be okay, though?

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:22.840
Speaking of which, don't those stones get picked up by...

00:21:28.590 --> 00:21:29.720
This is...

00:21:30.100 --> 00:21:32.470
It's the Shuten gang's hideout.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:36.730
Nonsuke, I can hear something.

00:21:48.700 --> 00:21:51.160
Looks like they're here for you. Go home.

00:21:51.580 --> 00:21:55.160
Then what was all this about?
You just wanted to make me sing?

00:21:55.500 --> 00:22:00.040
I'll stir things up at the Kiyomizu Temple Rock Explosion, too.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:08.880
I hear you're doing some interesting things.

00:22:09.260 --> 00:22:10.140
Oh?

00:22:10.140 --> 00:22:13.310
To the captain of Kamogawa.

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:15.390
You knew?

00:22:15.850 --> 00:22:20.650
Everyone and their mothers have been saying that Maikos, We Are hate the Kamogawa Rockr's,

00:22:21.100 --> 00:22:23.440
but there's little mention of what you've been doing.

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:25.690
Do you have a private grudge or something?

00:22:28.110 --> 00:22:30.410
She's a jerk.

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:33.120
I could get involved if you want.

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:37.790
But I don't hold back when I'm killing time.

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:39.290
Is that all right?

00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:41.580
Please do so.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:47.050
Are you finished, evil Takumis?

00:22:47.760 --> 00:22:50.930
Those Takumi guys were all done in without anyone noticing?

00:22:56.560 --> 00:22:59.310
Man, you guys weren't playing around.

00:23:00.060 --> 00:23:03.900
Even Buddha would be surprised that these are all missiles...

00:23:06.270 --> 00:23:09.150
Looks like I won't be bored anymore.

00:23:11.320 --> 00:23:16.490
Thou shalt not pass

00:23:16.790 --> 00:23:21.870
Laws, reason, nobody is getting past

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:27.710
I don't care what you say

00:23:27.710 --> 00:23:33.180
I'm not letting friends and lovers in either

00:23:33.890 --> 00:23:37.310
My only companion

00:23:38.640 --> 00:23:43.060
is the faint moonlight

00:23:44.150 --> 00:23:54.990
I'm now sitting in the cockpit

00:23:55.240 --> 00:24:01.250
of the black shadow

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:04.880
deep in the white moon

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:11.920
Of the black shadow

00:24:12.300 --> 00:24:15.760
deep in the white moon

00:24:28.020 --> 00:24:30.940
You've probably already realized, but this show is a work of fiction.
Any resemblance to real people, groups, or laws is coincidental.
